  <item>
    <title>Ep14 毛的多元宇宙 Part1</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/655d7d459f440f544387cf61</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">655d7d459f440f544387cf61</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Nov 2023 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【好的，领导】</span></strong><span>是由</span><strong><span>《基本无害》人间观察18群毛书记的粉丝</span></strong><span>，共同策划编辑而成的一档众筹播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hello~各位领导们，好久不见！欢迎来到首届【毛的多元宇宙】巅峰论坛。我们很荣幸受邀与《基本不睡》和《始终无害》的几位主创朋友们以共创播客为主题来分享我们的制作心得，探讨未来的发展前景，让我们掌声欢迎来自15群《基本不睡》的招谁和23群《始终无害》的仔嘟、Tiffany、Lily和泉君。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容索引】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a> &nbsp;开场（Tiffany、仔嘟、Lily、泉君、招谁、白鸽、小玛）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a> &nbsp;开始做共创博客的起源和初衷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;制作播客过程中印象最深的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1286">21:26</a> &nbsp;征集类型节目如何去做到让群里小伙伴们保持活跃度可以踊跃投稿的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1926">32:06</a> &nbsp;之前想过但没能做成节目的企划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2256">37:36</a> &nbsp;第一期节目的时候有没有预想过最少做到第几期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> &nbsp;大家最后断更的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2854">47:34</a> &nbsp;周边播客的发展前景和出路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">57:20</a> &nbsp;音乐是基本无害里面非常非常重要的一个元素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3547">59:07</a> &nbsp;在制作节目时对bgm的选择及音乐对节目的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3777">62:57</a> &nbsp;宁来对音乐记忆的寄语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3936">65:36</a> &nbsp;歌曲推荐环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4197">69:57</a> &nbsp;对Part2的企划征集计划与期待</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM &nbsp;List】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Floor Cry-Next Best Thing</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lukas Graham-Funeral</span></p><span></span><p><span>新学校废物合唱团-干杯时我会想起你</span></p><span></span><p><span>刺猬-生之响往</span></p><span></span><p><span>GALA-北戴河之歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>伍佰 &amp; China Blue-再度重相逢</span></p><span></span><p><span>林忆莲-分分钟需要你</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>15群《基本不睡》：招谁</span></p><span></span><p><span>18群《好的，领导》：白鸽/小玛/宁来（文字出境）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>23群《始终无害》：仔嘟/Tiffany/Lily/泉君</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>23群《始终无害》：仔嘟（感谢仔嘟的精心剪辑</span></p><span></span><p><span>正如节目中所说，本期也是我们时隔几个月的第一次更新。希望这期节目可以为我们注入新的能量。关于后面Part2的征集部分，大家敬请期待！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>希望大家收听开心，开心是最重要的！</span></strong><span> \(≧▽≦)/</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqmxlEmRe24Ewl1O833j05DW2sQN.m4a" length="105165317" type="audio/mp4"/>
