    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZobV9PRlh2US05UEROOXZiRHg3QmkyTzNEdF8ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep13 2022最后一天，让我们共同举杯，干了这杯可可芭蕾加波霸加茶冻</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63aff70ee7ab859986035b03</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63aff70ee7ab859986035b03</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 31 Dec 2022 08:47:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【好的，领导。】是由《基本无害》人间观察18群毛书记的粉丝，共同策划编辑而成的一档众筹播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hi 各位领导，大家好，2022转眼就过去了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一年，我们都发现身体健康真的很重要；</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一年，我们都取得了或大或小的成就；</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一年，开心、困惑、遗憾、焦虑、激动、期待，确定的事是：我们都在认真过好这一年的每一天。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期，我们邀请了7位小伙伴一起来聊聊即将过去的2022年，一起畅想2023年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【好的，领导。】将和大家继续同行，一起朝着2023年大步向前！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Sharers】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> &nbsp;开场 白鸽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> &nbsp;小喷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;大大青草糖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">08:49</a> &nbsp;VIVIAN</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="704">11:44</a> &nbsp;宇宙牌面包片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="804">13:24</a> &nbsp;柳儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1094">18:14</a> &nbsp;玛卡瑞纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">22:43</a> &nbsp;重玄</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Staff】</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：玛卡瑞纳</span></p><span></span><p><span>统筹：柳儿、重玄</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑/主播：白鸽</span></p><span></span><p><span>：）祝领导们在2023年平安健康，万事顺遂！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;记得开心是最重要的哦 \(≧▽≦)/</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltfNYaqm58R2T-VZzbElTdRKDa2Z.m4a" length="50679217" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzTFBZTEtvMTF0eFRrZk5DLUYyOGlxNkNCT2YucG5n.png"/>
