  <item>
    <title>Ep12 七夕特辑：那些Crush的瞬间无比珍贵</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62ea89974c0068105f917d3e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62ea89974c0068105f917d3e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Aug 2022 14:43:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【好的，领导。】</span></strong><span>是由</span><strong><span>《基本无害》人间观察18群</span></strong><span>毛书记的粉丝，共同策划编辑而成的一档众筹播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hi 各位领导，大家好，我们的线上录制又来啦！明天就是一年一度的七夕节了，又到了聊爱情的时间啦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱情，是一个怎么聊也聊不够的话题，在爱情里，有百转千回，有默默守护，有喜怒哀乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目里，有故事，有感悟，有态度，有观察，有关于爱情的一切！</span></p><span></span><p><span>话不多说，快来收听本期内容吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Sharers】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> &nbsp;开场 白鸽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">03:46</a> &nbsp;技巧经营和rua上去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="719">11:59</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;因为是母胎单身而被人拒绝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a> &nbsp;母单的人是很宝贵的，非常值得被爱被尊重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="946">15:46</a> &nbsp;航航、云汐Battle为啥常年单身不谈对象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a> &nbsp;姐姐 致命的弱点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> &nbsp;唐书记 我们这种小城市里最平常的恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3353">55:53</a> &nbsp;青草糖 遭遇了多线操作的渣男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4399">73:19</a> &nbsp;全程没有透露姓名的热心观众 分享被出轨经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5250">87:30</a> &nbsp;xixi 分享近期的crush</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Staff】</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：玛卡瑞纳</span></p><span></span><p><span>统筹：柳儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑/主播：白鸽</span></p><span></span><p><span>：）在年轻的时候，不要那么急着去当感情的“结果论者”，尽情去体会人跟人之间不同情愫的浓淡跟起起伏伏，是很值得的一件事，因为至少那个时候，你所见的人和人之间还有情，跟你今后漫长几十年要体会的柴米油盐日复一日比起来，要精彩绚烂不少。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpkqM722KbAyLOQOtA39fScWn2Wm.m4a" length="155777729" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:47:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzTFBZTEtvMTF0eFRrZk5DLUYyOGlxNkNCT2YucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep11 礼物魔法</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62d91f9cfa15142e17251dfa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62d91f9cfa15142e17251dfa</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Jul 2022 09:42:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【好的，领导。】</span></strong><span>是由</span><strong><span>《基本无害》人间观察18群毛书记的粉丝</span></strong><span>，共同策划编辑而成的一档众筹播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>礼物是带着魔法的，</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些有关在意、温柔和爱的小心思都藏在小时候的糖果里，</span></p><span></span><p><span>藏在热恋时的花束里，</span></p><span></span><p><span>藏在精心写好的书信里，</span></p><span></span><p><span>等待着被拆开，被看到。</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家收到过什么样的「礼物」，</span></p><span></span><p><span>送出过什么样的「礼物」，</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及发生过什么样的「礼物」故事，</span></p><span></span><p><span>浪漫的，忧伤的，欢乐的，搞笑的，社死的......</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们邀请了八位朋友来分享一下他们和礼物之间的故事，</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们一起来聆听那些旧故事里被时光虚化的浪漫吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Sharers】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;白鸽——开场及他的礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> &nbsp;人间指南——对象就是上天给他的礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> &nbsp;困困——送闺蜜写真，以及超级创意的情侣日历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1105">18:25</a> &nbsp;宇宙牌面包片——收了并不快乐的礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> &nbsp;重玄——携妻子聊送收礼物的价值观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1834">30:34</a> &nbsp;玛卡瑞纳——我恋爱了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2067">34:27</a> &nbsp;队长——也许这就是合格的礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2576">42:56</a> &nbsp;柳儿——鲜花就能给人最直接的快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM List】</span></p><span></span><p><span>as2134u——kissing the fire</span></p><span></span><p><span>Harry Styles——Sweet Creature</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lotte Kestner——Wait For Me</span></p><span></span><p><span>Per-Olov Kindgren——l am So Sorry</span></p><span></span><p><span>Per-Olov Kindgren——l Miss You</span></p><span></span><p><span>Per-Olov Kindgren——Loving You</span></p><span></span><p><span>Phil Keaggy——Renaissance Boy</span></p><span></span><p><span>See you again(吉他版纯音乐)</span></p><span></span><p><span>顾椎蔚——同桌的你(吉他版)</span></p><span></span><p><span>许巍——礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Staff】</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：玛卡瑞纳</span></p><span></span><p><span>统筹：柳儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑/主播：白鸽</span></p><span></span><p><span>你认真生活的样子，胜过世间所有的温柔 ：）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lthIGtJ6wXqEwsimRK5EKTgr9ID8.m4a" length="96472820" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzTFBZTEtvMTF0eFRrZk5DLUYyOGlxNkNCT2YucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep10 如果谈论电影，我们应该谈论些什么？一个“电影观众”的自我修养</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62c6dee847ac309e2113880b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62c6dee847ac309e2113880b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Jul 2022 13:25:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【好的，领导。】</span></strong><span>是由</span><strong><span>《基本无害》人间观察18群</span></strong><span>毛书记的粉丝，共同策划编辑而成的一档众筹播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- - - - - - - - - - - - - -</span></p><span></span><p><span>贫乏的人生，</span></p><span></span><p><span>短暂的生命，</span></p><span></span><p><span>烈士暮年即使是真要追忆似水年华，</span></p><span></span><p><span>也要有足够的往事，</span></p><span></span><p><span>来满足我们丰富饱满的情感、激动与幻想，</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及对未来的憧憬，</span></p><span></span><p><span>对亲情的思考，</span></p><span></span><p><span>对友情的渴望，</span></p><span></span><p><span>对爱情的探索，</span></p><span></span><p><span>而这些都可以在电影中获得。</span></p><span></span><p><span>过别人的生活，</span></p><span></span><p><span>体验他人的爱恨，</span></p><span></span><p><span>反思他人的抉择，</span></p><span></span><p><span>在面对命运的百般捉弄之后，</span></p><span></span><p><span>该有怎样的对策？</span></p><span></span><p><span>当电影散场，人生依旧，太阳照常升起，</span></p><span></span><p><span>而电影里的人生实验即使再惊心动魄，</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为观众，我们都无需负责。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想这就是电影的意义。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容索引】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">00:03:05</a> &nbsp;我与电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">00:09:55</a> &nbsp;蝙蝠与蝙蝠侠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">00:19:45</a> &nbsp;今敏和他的“盗梦空间”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">00:25:07</a> &nbsp;扎克施耐德和他的“钢铁之躯”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">00:41:15</a> &nbsp;“不按套路出牌”的韩国电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2867">00:47:47</a> &nbsp;贾科长的江湖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3394">00:56:34</a> &nbsp;另一个“疯狂”的山西老乡宁浩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3950">01:05:50</a> &nbsp;昆汀的暴力美学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4290">01:11:30</a> &nbsp;永远的电影大师杨德昌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4802">01:20:02</a> &nbsp;一个划水的电影推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>主 播/剪 辑：Mr. Lee</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家收听开心，开心是最重要的哦 ：）</span></p>]]></description>
