    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【好的，领导。】</span></strong><span>是由</span><strong><span>《基本无害》人间观察18群</span></strong><span>毛书记的粉丝，共同策划编辑而成的一档众筹播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这匆忙的城市中</span></p><span></span><p><span>抽出时间来</span></p><span></span><p><span>阅读一本书</span></p><span></span><p><span>停下脚步，目光专注，缓一缓，静一静</span></p><span></span><p><span>指腹翻过书页</span></p><span></span><p><span>笔尖划过墨香</span></p><span></span><p><span>读一本书，看一段人生</span></p><span></span><p><span>让书中的世界照进现实</span></p><span></span><p><span>现实中的人走进故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，这里是好的领导读书分享专栏</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分享的是陈春成短篇小说集《夜晚的潜水艇》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【sharers】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a> 白鸽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a> 大大青草糖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> 羽纯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a> 柳儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a> 七棠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1583">26:23</a> 重玄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1863">31:03</a> 宁来</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM &nbsp;List】</span></p><span></span><p><span>river flows in you——Yiruma</span></p><span></span><p><span>水中BGM~ワーニング~水中BGM ハリーアップ! (スーパーマリオブラザーズ)——近藤浩治</span></p><span></span><p><span>α pav——ζ</span></p><span></span><p><span>β pav——λ</span></p><span></span><p><span>photograph——Arcade Fire</span></p><span></span><p><span>Juliette Et Alexandre——Andre Gagnon</span></p><span></span><p><span>From here to somewhere——α pav</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Lost —— Otto A Totland</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vates —— Otto A Totland</span></p><span></span><p><span>Second Call—— Otto A Totland</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Staff】</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：玛卡瑞