  <item>
    <title>Ep6 关于疫情的生活 | 新生、适应、透明、笑容、坚信、沉默、晴天 。（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62790adb969de4d438384581</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62790adb969de4d438384581</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 May 2022 12:36:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【好的，领导。】</span></strong><span>是由</span><strong><span>《基本无害》人间观察18群</span></strong><span>毛书记的粉丝，共同策划编辑而成的一档众筹播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>疫情时代下的相遇、离别，到最后也许都是一个“没能追上夕阳”的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无法预料何时的道别会是永别，每个人的离开就都有了足够的理由。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以这样，我们不提对错，都欣然接受吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>酸涩涌过的鼻尖，眼泪划过的面颊，冲破胸膛的愤怒，劫后余生的庆幸。</span></p><span></span><p><span>原本麻木于断舍离的人们，这场疫情后可能又会重新拾起曾经有过的期盼与悸动。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每个奋力奔向未来的人，都像清晨缓缓升起的朝阳，照亮着前方。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Sharers】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a> 白鸽 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 小项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 枣糕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">12:52</a> 羽纯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1046">17:26</a> 树袋袋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1284">21:24</a> 小溪（白鸽代读）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1829">30:29</a> 宁来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2104">35:04</a> &nbsp;白鸽 结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM &nbsp;List】</span></p><span></span><p><span>高级动物伴奏—不要遮住我的阳光</span></p><span></span><p><span>3 Gymnopedies:i. Lent Et Douloureux—Aldo Ciccolini</span></p><span></span><p><span>雨忆—九千七</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lucidity—Yn1Jasper</span></p><span></span><p><span>过程—陈知游园惊梦</span></p><span></span><p><span>妈妈的歌谣—莫西子诗</span></p><span></span><p><span>散步、北京—梁晓雪</span></p><span></span><p><span>井山的胡同—梁晓雪</span></p><span></span><p><span>时久拾疤—文雀</span></p><span></span><p><span>那年小学语文老师教音乐—早西</span></p><span></span><p><span>南方小镇(双吉他)—董运昌</span></p><span></span><p><span>花—Hello Nico</span></p><span></span><p><span>[钢琴] five hundred miles—昼夜</span></p><span></span><p><span>聋草花-钢琴版—锦鲤少年</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hey Jude—lmaginary Future</span></p><span></span><p><span>想去海边—夏日入侵企画</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Staff】</span></p><span></span><p><span>鬼才策划：玛卡瑞纳</span></p><span></span><p><span>三军统筹：宁来</span></p><span></span><p><span>百万剪辑：白鸽</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家收听开心，开心是最重要的哦 ：）</span></p>]]></description>
