    <guid isPermaLink="false">6267ee1feabd9b6af9c3117d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Apr 2022 13:05:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【好的，领导。】</span></strong><span>是由</span><strong><span>《基本无害》人间观察18群</span></strong><span>毛书记的粉丝，共同策划编辑而成的一档众筹播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>1922年，英国诗人托马斯艾略特发表了他最著名的诗作《荒原》</span></p><span></span><p><span>当时，一战刚结束没多久，西方社会失去了信仰支撑，传统的价值观衰败，新的价值观还未确立，人们对社会充满了绝望。</span></p><span></span><p><span>《荒原》用晦涩难懂的文字，表达了100年前的那一代人在精神上的幻灭：</span></p><span></span><p><span>四月是最残忍的月份，</span></p><span></span><p><span>从死去的土地里培育出丁香，</span></p><span></span><p><span>把记忆和欲望混合在一起，</span></p><span></span><p><span>用春雨搅动迟钝的根蒂。</span></p><span></span><p><span>冬天总使我们感到温暖，</span></p><span></span><p><span>把大地覆盖在健忘的雪里，</span></p><span></span><p><span>用干燥的块茎喂养一个短暂的生命。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Sharers】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">00:12</a> 宁来 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 玛卡瑞纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 李队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a> 困困</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">18:52</a> 白鸽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1492">24:52</a> 汤包</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1876">31:16</a> 宇宙牌面包片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a>&nbsp;Vivian</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2098">34:58</a> 重玄&amp;宁元一</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM &nbsp;List】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a> &nbsp;mad world</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> &nbsp;α·Pav-ε</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> &nbsp;α·Pav - υ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a> &nbsp;α·Pav - μ¹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">07:33</a> &nbsp;α-Pav - The Last Shelteraav - a</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">08:52</a> &nbsp;α-Pav - Lost Memories</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> &nbsp;α·Pav - ...Then We Start A New Voyage</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> &nbsp;齐一- 生命中的时光 (Live 深圳, 2018)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="969">16:09</a> &nbsp;α·Pav - 雨と電車</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> &nbsp;何真真 - 橘色温度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a> &nbsp;Daydream - A Sleeping Forest</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1505">25:05</a> &nbsp;α·Pav - 始まりの春</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1573">26:13</a> &nbsp;α·Pav - θ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> &nbsp;路飞文 - 嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1878">31:18</a> &nbsp;α·Pav -η</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> &nbsp;α·Pav -秋～華恋～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2274">37:54</a> &nbsp;α·Pav -κ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2401">40:01</a> &nbsp;α·Pav -δ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2527">42:07</a> &nbsp;α·Pav - ζ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2699">44:59</a> &nbsp;α·Pav - α</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2865">47:45</a> &nbsp;α·Pav - λ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3077">51:17</a> &nbsp;α·Pav - ξ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">52:20</a> &nbsp;凌川