    <title>Ep2 春日漫谈｜回家时我发现忘了带钥匙， 原来我被锁在了这个世界里。（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62426a4cd485a5cd7767fd13</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62426a4cd485a5cd7767fd13</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Mar 2022 02:09:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【好的，领导。】</span></strong><span>是由</span><strong><span>《基本无害》人间观察18群</span></strong><span>毛书记的粉丝，共同策划编辑而成的一档众筹播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们邀请了基本无害18群的12位朋友讲一讲他们和</span><strong><span>春天的故事</span></strong><span>，听听他们对春天的想象。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也许这并不是一个温暖的春天，也不是一个充满善意的世界。我们希望把对于春天和未来的美好期许，在此刻写下，在心中播撒。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望如约而至的除了春天，还有疫情过后平安的你。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是爱，是暖，是希望，</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是人间的四月天。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>希望大家收听开心，开心是最重要的：）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【内容索引】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 小项 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 宁来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> loki</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 柳儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> 比U比U</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a> Mr.Lee</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2435">40:35</a> xixi</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 重玄</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>明天会更好——群星合唱</span></p><span></span><p><span>情非得已——庾澄庆</span></p><span></span><p><span>Girls&amp;Boys——blur</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stupid love song——Morrie</span></p><span></span><p><span>Have a nice day-魏如萱</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏色片想い——菊池桃子</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fish in the pool——岩井俊二</span></p><span></span><p><span>なごり雪——中森明菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>你不是真正的快乐——五月天</span></p><span></span><p><span>孙悟空——五月天</span></p><span></span><p><span>色彩斑斓——海妖</span></p><span></span><p><span>shalala——海妖</span></p><span></span><p><span>JOY——石井明美</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：玛卡瑞纳</span></p><span></span><p><span>统筹：宁来</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：小项</span></p>]]></description>
