    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【好的，领导。】</span></strong><span>是由</span><strong><span>《基本无害》人间观察18群</span></strong><span>毛书记的粉丝，共同策划编辑而成的一档众筹播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在毛书记的感召下，18群小伙伴们自力更生、艰苦奋斗，在繁忙的工作之余，大家利用健康的</span><strong><span>摸鱼时间</span></strong><span>各尽所能，最终筹备出我们的第一期节目：</span><strong><span>《阿毛历险记》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>第一期节目是由20位小伙伴以故事接龙的形式，每人分别撰写及录制而成。故事仅要求以阿毛为主人公，题材不限，可尽情发挥。参与者轮流进行故事后续的再创作，接龙过程中，大家展现出了各自清奇的脑洞和有趣的灵魂。故事走向一波三折，剧情跌宕起伏，现实与魔幻题材交相辉映，希望大家能够喜欢。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在此也感谢加入我们创作的每一位小伙伴，正是大家的肯定与支持，才得以将灵魂碰撞出的火花具象的展示给大家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也感谢我们可爱的毛书记，</span><strong><span>《好的，领导》</span></strong><span>“另起炉灶”也是致敬您给予的第一簇火苗，由衷祝福毛书记能够早日拥有自己的庄园，那时我们一定准时搬着墩儿到你的专场观看演出，一起唱歌，一起跳舞，一起举杯，一起热爱我们所爱…</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>希望大家收听开心，开心是最重要的：）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【内容索引】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:11</a> 小项 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span>故事接龙：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 美娜酱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 黄小丹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> 玛卡瑞纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 宁来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 汤包</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">03:04</a> 宇宙牌面包片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 大花花子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a> 烤冷面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a> 佳琳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">04:51</a> Steve</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="306">05:06</a> Sophia</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a> 羽纯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">06:11</a> 重玄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">06:44</a> 困困</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a> 大风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a> 小溪啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a> 树袋袋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">09:18</a> J</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="594">09:54</a> 小项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> 大甜甜圈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Labor In Vain(reprise)——利纳斯的毛毯</span></p><span></span><p><span>雪花（2022 北京冬奥会开幕式主题曲）——北京爱乐合唱团</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：玛卡瑞纳</span></p><span></span><p><span>统筹：宁来</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：小项</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：小项</span></p>]]></description>
